- The temperature \( T(t) \) changes with time \( t \) according to the equation:
  \[
  T(t) = T_0 \left(1 + \beta t^{\frac{1}{4}}\right)
  \]
- The heat capacity \( C \) is given by:
  \[
  C = \frac{4 P \left(T(t) - T_0\right)^2}{\beta^4 T_0^3}
  \]

